"Another way to pass local_rank to the subprocesses via environment "
"variable LOCAL_RANK. This behavior is enabled when you launch the script "
"with --use-env=True. You must adjust the subprocess example above to "
"replace args.local_rank with os.environ['LOCAL_RANK']; the launcher will "
"not pass --local-rank when you specify this flag."
