"ranks calling into torch.distributed.monitored_barrier() within the "
"provided timeout. torch.distributed.monitored_barrier() implements a "
"host-side barrier using send/recv communication primitives in a process "
"similar to acknowledgements, allowing rank 0 to report which rank(s) "
"failed to acknowledge the barrier in time. As an example, consider the "
"following function where rank 1 fails to call into "
"torch.distributed.monitored_barrier() (in practice this could be due to "
"an application bug or hang in a previous collective):"
