#: ../../source/references_other.md:2141
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This hook should only be used for headroom analysis of allreduce "
"optimization, instead of the normal gradient synchronization. For "
"example, if only less than 10% speedup of training time can be observed "
"after this hook is registered, it usually implies that allreduce is not a"
" performance bottleneck for this case. Such instrumentation can be "
