msgid ""
"To visualize the sharding of a DTensor that have less than 3 dimensions, "
"DTensor provides visualize_sharding():"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3235
msgid "Visualizes sharding in the terminal for DTensor that are 1D or 2D."
msgstr ""

