"Iterable[torch.nn.Parameter]]]) – Input passed into the optimizer "
"representing either a list of parameter groups or an iterable of "
"parameters; if None, then this method assumes the input was "
"model.parameters(). This argument is deprecated, and there is no need to "
"pass it in anymore. (Default: None)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3552 ../../source/references_other.md:3588
msgid ""
"optim (Optional[torch.optim.Optimizer]) – Optimizer that will load the "
"state dict returned by this method. This is the preferred argument to use"
" over optim_input. (Default: None)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3556 ../../source/references_other.md:3590
msgid ""
"The full optimizer state dict now remapped to flattened parameters "
"instead of unflattened parameters and restricted to only include this "
"rank’s part of the optimizer state."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3558 ../../source/references_other.md:3600
msgid ""
"Set the state_dict_type of all the descendant FSDP modules of the target "
"module."
