msgid "This API should be called for only the top-level (root) module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3564
msgid ""
"This API enables users to transparently use the conventional state_dict "
"API to take model checkpoints in cases where the root FSDP module is "
"wrapped by another nn.Module. For example, the following will ensure "
"state_dict is called on all non-FSDP instances, while dispatching into "
"sharded_state_dict implementation for FSDP:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3566 ../../source/references_other.md:3604
msgid "module (torch.nn.Module) – Root module."
msgstr ""

