#: ../../source/references_other.md:3572
msgid ""
"optim_state_dict_config (Optional[OptimStateDictConfig]) – the "
"configuration for the optimizer state dict."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3574
msgid ""
"A StateDictSettings that include the previous state_dict type and "
"configuration for the module."
msgstr ""

