msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3582
msgid ""
"full_optim_state_dict (Dict[str, Any]) – Optimizer state dict "
"corresponding to the unflattened parameters and holding the full non-"
"sharded optimizer state."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3592
msgid "Return the optimizer state-dict in its sharded form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3594
msgid ""
"The API is similar to full_optim_state_dict() but this API chunks all "
"non-zero-dimension states to ShardedTensor to save memory. This API "
"should only be used when the model state_dict is derived with the context"
" manager with state_dict_type(SHARDED_STATE_DICT):."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3596
msgid "For the detailed usage, refer to full_optim_state_dict()."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/references_other.md:3598
msgid ""
"The returned state dict contains ShardedTensor and cannot be directly "
"used by the regular optim.load_state_dict."
msgstr ""

