"requires the model is traceable with torch.Export. Composability of the "
"resulting nn.Module with other parallelism techniques is experimental, "
"and may require some workarounds. Usage of this frontend may be more "
"appealing if the user cannot easily change the model code. See Option 2: "
"splitting a model automatically for more information."
msgstr ""

